      "updated": 1700000000000, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "3. DB Transaction (TransactionTemplate)\n────────────────────────────────\nload seat from Postgres\nif HELD + no Redis key → reconcile to EXPIRED\nflip seat.status = HELD (@Version check)\ninsert reservation row (uuid pre-assigned)",
